      "message": "There were some concerns about going into the \u0027parked\u0027 code-path when folks didn\u0027t have any listeners. See https://gerrit-review.googlesource.com/c/gerrit/+/247812/comment/3fd40ffb_8bf75499/. If you want to remove it, maybe do it in a separate change?",
